action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P102 on Windows, GtkBackend (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): longPressTextSelection() in a TextField and a TextEditor,
# and not in a plain TextField -- the steps of actions/win/P102-long-press-drag.actions, re-measured for GTK.
#   TEST_BACKEND=gtk4 zsh testapp/test.zsh P102 --windows --actionfile testapp/actions/win/P102-long-press-drag-gtk4.actions
# Positions from the test.zsh capture on 2026-10-23 (origin=frame: the capture's own pixels, shadow included).
# GTK lays out about 20 px lower than WinUI: the WinUI file's FIELD row (y 189) lands on the FIELD label here.
# FIELD text at y 209 ('quick' at x 80), EDITOR lines at y 273/291/308, CONTROL at y 431.
# Pass (p102-select.log): FIELD began with an empty range then ended forward and non-empty; EDITOR ended
# backward; no line at all for the CONTROL press or for the quick FIELD drag at the end (held 0.1 s).
# P102(Windows,GtkBackend):長按後拖曳，步驟同 actions/win/P102-long-press-drag.actions,座標為 GTK 重新量測
# (2026-10-23,origin=frame 即截圖本身的像素，含陰影)。GTK 的版面比 WinUI 低約 20 px:WinUI 檔的 FIELD 列(y 189)
# 在這裡落在 FIELD 標籤上。通過條件:FIELD 先以空範圍 began、再以非空的正向範圍 ended;EDITOR ended 為 backward;
# CONTROL 的長按與最後那次快速拖曳都不能有任何一行。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P102 lay out,windows
mousedown,80,209,frame,left,,,FIELD: press on 'quick',windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,hold past the 0.5 s long-press delay,windows
move,120,209,frame,,,,drag right,windows
sleep,,,,,,100000,,windows
move,170,209,frame,,,,drag right,windows
sleep,,,,,,100000,,windows
move,220,209,frame,,,,drag right,windows
sleep,,,,,,150000,,windows
mouseup,220,209,frame,left,,,let go -- the selection stays,windows
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,windows
mousedown,120,308,frame,left,,,EDITOR: press on the third line,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,hold,windows
move,95,296,frame,,,,drag up and left,windows
sleep,,,,,,100000,,windows
move,70,285,frame,,,,drag up and left,windows
sleep,,,,,,100000,,windows
move,45,273,frame,,,,onto the first line,windows
sleep,,,,,,150000,,windows
mouseup,45,273,frame,left,,,let go -- backward selection stays,windows
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,windows
mousedown,60,431,frame,left,,,CONTROL: a long press with no modifier,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,hold,windows
move,150,431,frame,,,,drag,windows
sleep,,,,,,150000,,windows
mouseup,150,431,frame,left,,,let go -- nothing may be logged,windows
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,windows
mousedown,45,209,frame,left,,,FIELD: a quick drag,windows
sleep,,,,,,100000,held only 0.1 s,windows
move,150,209,frame,,,,drag right -- the toolkit's drag-select,windows
sleep,,,,,,150000,,windows
mouseup,150,209,frame,left,,,let go -- nothing may be logged,windows
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let the last settled line be written,windows
